Potential Training Path

Here’s a recommended sequence to learn WXP:

  > Platform Fundamentals

Learn what WXP does and how data flows into it.

> Understand key dashboards and metrics.

Getting Started & Admin Setup

Setting up your admin account

Preferences, user roles, and permissions

Installing and configuring data collectors

Analytics & Insights

Device performance and health analytics

Workforce experience scoring

Reporting and dashboards

Collaboration (WXP Collaboration)

Setting up and connecting collaboration data

Interpreting meeting quality and usage KPIs

How to use collaboration insights to optimize UC platforms

Advanced Usage

Integrations (e.g., ServiceNow, PowerBI)

Automated remediation

Employee engagement & sentiment analysis
